{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01664","headline":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行 · 虞羽客","name":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽幷侠少年，金络控连钱。\n窃符方救赵，击筑正怀燕。\n轻生辞凤阙，挥袂上祁连。\n陆离横宝劒，出没惊徂旃。\n蒙轮恒顾敌，超乘忽争先。\n摧枯逾百战，拓地远三千。\n骨都魂已散，楼兰首复传。\n龙城含晓雾，瀚海隔遥天。\n歌吹金微返，振旅玉门旋。\n烽火今已息，非复照甘泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞羽客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}